pg-trickle (0.90.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Upgrade to the signed upstream v0.90.0 tag archive.
  * Rebase the package on cargo-pgrx/pgrx 0.19.2 and a fixed 450-package
    Cargo.lock without git dependencies.
  * Keep PostgreSQL 18 as the only supported major, carry every migration SQL
    file including all 27 edges from 0.81.0, and install pg_trickle_dump.
  * Repair the 0.82 RETURNS TABLE/view descriptors and ACLs, defer all dynamic
    CDC rebuilds through the continuous write outage, and preserve fresh-install
    function, view, constraint, comment, and privilege parity; recognize the
    two lifecycle functions' existing pinned search_path in the metadata gate.
  * Document the mandatory V1-to-V2 DAG recreation, terminal consumer
    acknowledgment, guarded stale-buffer cleanup, and resnapshot boundary.

